nal/2bmunMO1NTiZHymLQKZog2qxLfx.jpg"},{"id":230471,"name":"Kana Ueda","role":"Subaru (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us6FMwXCeSUR2YyByxVcgOUjiIA.jpg"},{"id":90134,"name":"Tetsuya Kakihara","role":"Gouki Aratake (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/80DeAD6DYh030wsyUygFqDpNkSj.jpg"},{"id":1255652,"name":"Hiromi Igarashi","role":"Hyoudou Aoi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVQfafFKUWZMNxqGYlHc2EPyNhc.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Maid-sama! - La doppia vita di Misaki","overview":"Ayuzawa Misaki è la presidentessa del consiglio d’istituto dell’ex scuola maschile, Seika High School, ora aperta anche alle ragazze. Allo scopo di proteggere le neo-iscritte dalla ben poco galante fauna maschile, Misaki ingaggerà una battaglia senza esclusione di colpi con i ragazzi. La presidentessa nasconde, però, un piccolo segreto: lavora in un “Maid Cafè”. Sfortunatamente verrà scoperta da un popolarissimo studente della scuola, Usui Takumi, che metterà in pericolo la sua doppia vita da maid e presidentessa del consiglio d’istituto!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Maid Sama!","overview":"Misaki Ayuzawa is the first female student council president at a once all-boys school turned co-ed. She rules the school with strict discipline demeanor. But she has a secret, she works at a maid cafe due to her families circumstances. One day the popular A-student and notorious heart breaker Takumi Usui finds out her secret and makes a deal with her to keep it hush from the school in exchange for spending some time with him."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"会長はメイド様！","overview":"文武両道の完璧な会長は、実はメイドさんだった！\n\n元・男子校だった星華高校は、男子生徒が全体の8割を占めている。\n\n数少ない女子生徒は粗野で無神経な男子に耐えるのみの毎日を送っている。\n\nそんな状況を打開すべく、初の女生徒会長になったのが鮎沢美咲！\n\n文武両道の美咲は、規律ある学校生活をもたらすべく日々奮闘していた。\n\nだが、美咲にはある秘密があった。\n\nそれは…\n\n“メイド喫茶”でアルバイトをしていること！！\n\n周りにバレないようにと願いながらアルバイトを続けるある日、\n\n学校一のモテ男・碓氷拓海に見られてしまい、最大のピンチ！\n\n美咲の、“生徒会長”と“メイド”の二重生活はどうなる！？","tagline":"文武両道の完璧な会長は、実はメイドさんだった！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/42ZO8rTWelosVWIFAUHLLH6gyGU.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/42ZO8rTWelosVWIFAUHLLH6gyGU.png","language":"it","width":900,"height":232},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y7utDPb0GJGTWF7T4IiEO5TLImE.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y7utDPb0GJGTWF7T4IiEO5TLImE.png","language":"en","width":496,"height":298},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCBfOlmd6YVxus0Zz6Rv3GH5dnp.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCBfOlmd6YVxus0Zz6Rv3GH5dnp.png","language":"en","width":788,"height":213},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ba21sWWM862qP8IC2itWwGM4RpD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ba21sWWM862qP8IC2itWwGM4RpD.png","language":"ja","width":329,"height":182}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/igkn0M1bgMeATz59LShvVxZNdVd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/igkn0M1bgMeATz59LShvVxZNdVd.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7GQgwKhxyTgaIWtpGI5KEy9mUo9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7GQgwKhxyTgaIWtpGI5KEy9mUo9.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pr0g6CxJxBN8yR5sBdURwQLpQwM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pr0g6CxJxBN8yR5sBdURwQLpQwM.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjw3FJJrGsplagCcmjy7Ko4jF51.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rjw3FJJrGsplagCcmjy7Ko4jF51.jpg","language":"en","width":906,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ta12QFdlPcoEZj7OG57NsNqFI6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2ta12QFdlPcoEZj7OG57NsNqFI6.jpg","language":"e